# Normalize line endings so the format gate passes on every CI runner.
#
# .prettierrc.json pins endOfLine: "lf", but GitHub's windows-latest runner checks out
# with core.autocrlf=true, which turns the repository's LF into CRLF. Every file would
# then fail `prettier --check` on that runner while passing on the macOS and Ubuntu
# runners (and on a local LF checkout). Forcing LF on checkout keeps all three OS runners
# and every contributor in sync, without relaxing the Prettier rule.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Art is binary and must never be line-normalised.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
